---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---
<Base title="Privacy policy" description={`How ${SITE.name} handles personal data.`}>
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="small muted">Last updated: September 23, 2026</p>
    <h2>Controller</h2>
    <p>{SITE.owner}, contact: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a>. Full identification details are in the <a href="/legal-notice/">legal notice</a>.</p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>{SITE.name} has no accounts and no forms. If you email us, we use your address only to reply.</p>
    <h2>Advertising</h2>
    <p>This site shows ads served by Google AdSense. Google and its partners may use cookies to show ads based on your visits to this and other sites. In the EEA, UK and Switzerland, ads are only personalised if you consent through the consent message shown on your first visit, and you can change your choice at any time. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="nofollow noopener">how Google uses data from partner sites</a>.</p>
    <h2>Hosting and statistics</h2>
    <p>The site is hosted on Cloudflare, which processes technical data such as IP addresses to deliver and protect the site. Visit statistics use Cloudflare Web Analytics, which does not use cookies.</p>
    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>You can ask for access, correction or deletion of your data by email, and you can complain to the Spanish Data Protection Agency (AEPD).</p>
  </article>
</Base>
